                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I bought the game when it launched because it looked colorful, cute, and cozy. I only ended up playing it recently.\n\nAt first I was very skeptical about the potion system because the idea of running out to use for weapons did not seem like fun. However potion ingredients are plentiful, and it is never really an issue. More than that, it is easy enough to either use environmental factors to do you work for you, or strategically place enemies to attack each other.\n\nAfter about an hour in, I was made a believer, and ended up beating the game over a weekend. I really enjoyed myself, and even opted to lose sleep in favor of playing this game.",
